================================================================================
Scope of this file
================================================================================
This NOTICE covers third-party software that KubeMetal **orchestrates at
runtime** — spawned as a macOS host process, deployed as a Kubernetes
manifest/Helm chart, or invoked as an external CLI (see `resolve_cli_path` /
`external_command` in `src-tauri/src/services/process.rs`). None of it is
copied into or compiled into the KubeMetal binary.

Rust crates and npm packages that ARE compiled/bundled into the KubeMetal
binary are listed separately in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`, generated at
release time from `Cargo.lock` / `pnpm-lock.yaml` by
`scripts/release/gen_third_party_notices.sh` (see the release assets, or run
the script locally). A machine-readable inventory of the same compiled
dependency graph ships as a CycloneDX/SPDX SBOM with every release
(`scripts/release/gen_sbom.sh`) — see the "SBOM" section below.

