SBOM
================================================================================
Every tagged release attaches a CycloneDX and an SPDX SBOM
(`sbom-cyclonedx.json`, `sbom-spdx.json`), generated by
`scripts/release/gen_sbom.sh` from the exact `Cargo.lock` / `pnpm-lock.yaml`
of that tag via Trivy. These enumerate the compiled Rust/npm dependency
graph — the same scope as `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` — not the runtime-
orchestrated components listed above, which have no single lockfile to scan.

